Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1041] Onigashima 43 - Komurasaki.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:28.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am waiting for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:31.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:37.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I await your orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:43.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have come here...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:50.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to do battle at your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.82,0:01:55.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I spoke briefly with\NZunesha before this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:02:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Incredible, Momonosuke-kun!\NSo you can converse with the elephant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.91,0:02:03.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just as Oden predicted!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:08.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shall be the one to lead\Nthe world unto a new Dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:13.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alas, we are missing\Nthe most vital part to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:20.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By reading Father's journal, I understand\Nthat I must live, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.26,0:02:22.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...tore out the\Nmost important page himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:31.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Laugh Tale...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.86,0:02:33.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the final island!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:40.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did Roger, Father, and their crew\Nsee there that made them laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.65,0:02:43.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(961,80)}Oden's Travel Log
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:48.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do not understand\Nthe import of what I must achieve!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father was no prophet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Were he here now, would he still say\N"Open our borders" as he once did?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:02.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hardly consider myself wise!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If doing so were to put\Nthe people of Wano in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:08.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I would not want to open the borders!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:13.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does this make me a coward,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:14.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:26.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrot, head inside the dome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got our revenge!\NBut the battle's far from done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.29,0:03:35.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay sharp...\NGotta stay sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the heck knows when\Nthis'll all come crashin' down...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:42.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island gonna make it through?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:44.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not lettin' ya fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got all beat up, as usual
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm pullin' ya up right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:56.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're still breathin', right...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:58.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Zoro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You didn't die on me, did ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:05.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.99,0:04:09.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.83,0:04:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap... Crap! The castle looks like\Nit could collapse at any moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's the exit...?\NHamlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:21.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can count on me,\Nmy good man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:23.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm asking!\NMake it your job!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:26.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lives! Important!\NSafe delivery!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.98,0:04:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, hot, ow, hot, owhot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:39.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oww! Ouch!\N'Tis hot, hot! 'Tis not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.73,0:04:42.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nay, 'tis... not hot! It's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:54.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even we ninja ought to enjoy\Nfreedom in this day and age,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:05:00.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Castle Interior, Third Floor,\NBattle of the Connecting Passage...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:05:01.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(285,373)}The Victor:\NRaizo of the Mist!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The victor:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo of the Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:12.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you a samurai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:14.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you running?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:21.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You... are one of Luffy-dono's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must make haste!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:29.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in no state to do that!\NRelax, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:33.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A shame...\NI was fully prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:35.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, now!\NAre you that eager to die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I would ask a favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:17.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:22.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:47.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must live...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Izo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.89,0:07:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He planned to take us down\Nwith him from the start...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:17.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would some vestige of\NWhitebeard's crew bother saving brats?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:23.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have to hurry and\Nfind Nico Robin...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:25.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.11,0:07:27.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What now?! One damned\Nthing after another...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:28.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clik
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.24,0:07:30.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:33.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An Imperial Edict from\Nthe Five Celestial Elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:36.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Five Celestial Elders?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:39.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They declare...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:42.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Eliminate Straw Hat Luffy at once"!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:45.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you telling me to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:48.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is fighting\NKaido right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:52.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me to\Nintervene in Kaido's fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.55,0:07:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.59,0:07:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are well aware of the\Nimpossible nature of the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a world-class battle,\Nwhich is why it presents a great risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:04.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess why that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The order is a necessary precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:12.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A precaution against something\Neven the Five Celestial Elders are wary of...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:17.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something we hardly know of\Nthrough rumors and guesswork.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:18.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clik
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:24.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't die without\Nhaving done anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:28.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's so damned special...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:34.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...about that pirate crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:39.51,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1605,504)}Dome Interior\NForehead Floor\NAnimal Kingdom\NBath
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:42.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hihimaru...\NKomachiyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:45.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Both of yas did great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We beat Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a huge deal!\NReally huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:08.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't think Big Mom's\Ngonna come back after all that, do you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.17,0:09:10.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now hold on, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:18.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's more important to you,\NBig Mom or me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:20.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You, Nami!\NYou are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.47,0:09:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You, Nami!\NYou are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:28.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master! You must stay close to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.35,0:09:30.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Best keep on your toes\N'til it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right now, we're on...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:36.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the most dangerous island\Nin the world, yessir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:42.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy... Are you still fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:46.58,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(264,491)}2nd Floor\NTreasury
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.21,0:09:56.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:57.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it alll!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:10:01.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How long is he going\Nto make me wait?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:04.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Komurasaki!\NDon't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll make our way\Nout of here soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:10.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:15.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That damned worthless ninja!\NWhat could he possibly be doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have escaped\Non his own, could he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:20.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninja have no freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are to live while\Ntheir lord does, and die alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that tremor earlier\NKanjuro's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hope that was the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.02,0:10:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you perform\Nat a time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:01.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:03.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop your performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.12,0:11:08.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a life-or-death situation,\Nand you're here, all pretentious and in a mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:17.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, you've been\Nwearing it all along...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That mask...\NRemove it at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:29.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...truly...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Komurasaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you a ghost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:44.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you notice?\NDid you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:50.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now they've gone and done it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those damn idiots...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.69,0:13:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got Linlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:08.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jaggy and Traf did it?\NAwesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.41,0:13:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think we should ready up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:17.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...for Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:20.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the one we see\Ncoming down here is Kaido...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.35,0:13:37.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the energy left to fight back...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:48.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You there, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:51.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got a mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:53.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you talk or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How old are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.51,0:14:08.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fifteen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:09.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So young!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First time joining Rocks' crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a good-for-nothin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.35,0:14:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.56,0:14:24.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you got a problem,\Nyou talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:30.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Linlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the woman who's\Ngonna rule the seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:37.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice t'meetcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:43.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thinking about it now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...we went way back, you and I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.51,0:14:49.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You damn hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:53.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:00.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...right as we vowed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to go take the One Piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:06.90,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1474,680)}Tears in His Beer
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gear 4:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.51,0:15:32.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Snakeman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:36.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of\Nreminiscin' here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.77,0:15:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... I can't move...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't free myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:52.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were so beside yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So much so that\Nyou failed to take notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:16:00.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come now, Komurasaki!\NWhy are you just watching?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:03.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remove this rubble from me at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:09.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is it I can't transform?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So as to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:14.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,prevent you from\Ntransforming into a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:18.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you were pierced with\Na nail of Sea Stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:20.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,by none other than I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:22.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:25.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this I'm hearing from you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought you loved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:32.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Love... Absurd, coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:35.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bear no love toward you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.28,0:16:38.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By curious coincidence,\Nyour favorite piece...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Moon Princess"...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.75,0:16:50.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have improved, Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:52.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've taken a liking to that song!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:55.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?! 'Tis called "Moon Princess"!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.84,0:16:57.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will improve even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful song!\NPlay it at my funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:14.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, Momo!\NDo not make your sister cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.49,0:17:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Twas your doing, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was it what I said earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:21.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry. 'Twas in jest!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:24.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't be dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis the very piece...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...my father, Kozuki Oden, loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every time I perform\N"Moon Princess"...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.64,0:17:48.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I recall my father's face...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:55.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Father"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.15,0:17:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:00.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bear to smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:07.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...in front of you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.83,0:18:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:33.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dun care 'bout\Nwhatever goal you guys had!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Especially if it leaves\Nthe guys here in this country...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:41.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...with no food to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.07,0:18:45.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's my last Gear 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The punchin' ain't stoppin'\N'til I'm outta steam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:18:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got no freakin' clue where\Nhis punches are coming from!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:10.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.69,0:19:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...kick you outta Wano,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:16.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if it's the last thing I do!
